      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe configurations satisfy existing Turbo validation constraints and align with the documented MI355X test results.\n\n**0 open findings**\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nRoutes MI355X FP8 training through Primus-Turbo GEMMs to avoid Transformer Engine failures.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Enables Turbo dense and grouped GEMMs for Qwen3 with tensorwise FP8.\n- Enables Turbo dense GEMMs for DeepSeek V2 Lite using Triton.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI355X/​qwen3_30B_A3B-FP8-pretrain.yaml` | Enables Turbo GEMMs and compatible FP8 scaling. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI355X/​deepseek_v2_lite-FP8-pretrain.yaml` | Routes FP8 dense GEMMs to Triton. |\n</details>\n\n🧠 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/AMD-AGI/Primus/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
